    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_047a648f",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young girl holding a handgun, juxtaposed with the text 'it's time we took guns away and put them out of the reach of our children.' The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to evoke emotional responses (such as fear or concern for children's safety) to support the message of gun control. The visual of a child with a gun is used analogically to symbolize the danger of firearms in households and to frame the issue as a child safety concern, thereby influencing public opinion toward stricter gun laws. The meme does not contain explicit toxicity such as racism, antisemitism, misogyny, or ableism, but it does use a potentially harmful and emotionally manipulative visual metaphor to advance a political agenda. The intent is to persuade viewers to support gun control by associating firearms with child endangerment, leveraging the emotional weight of childhood innocence against the threat of violence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_bddd2d18"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
