      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8eee8814",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "gun_control_debate",
      "label": "Gun Control Debate",
      "description": "An ongoing national and international political and social debate concerning the regulation of firearms. This debate includes arguments about public safety, individual rights, gun ownership, and the role of government. The meme is part of this broader discourse, specifically advocating for stricter gun control measures.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
