      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Propaganda",
      "description": "The meme uses emotionally manipulative imagery of a child holding a gun to advocate for gun control, leveraging the association of firearms with child endangerment to influence public opinion. This is a form of political propaganda that frames the issue as a moral imperative to protect children, potentially exploiting fear and concern for children's safety.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
